{"version":1,"content":"<p>【小心 ⚠️】TikTok 經常流傳大量 Windows 11 系統「最佳化」短影片。</p><p>由於記憶體短缺的關係，不少 KOL 出片教人「停用 SysMain 服務」，聲稱可釋放記憶體並提升系統流暢度。</p><p>然而，科技媒體《Windows Latest》透過實測顯示，關閉 SysMain 不僅無法顯著提升現代電腦的運作效能，甚至會導致應用程式冷啟動（Cold Launch）時間大幅增加，直接推翻盲目停用該服務可加速系統的說法。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:21:55.142519+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:02:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:58:11.990844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:18:12.282583+00:00","content_hash":"8d7f8baf3bff360b83a2f95bd7eaa35c58fef34fda1e766b584156bf1f2319f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}